Proposed improvement: a compact, single-column form with a visible label, warm neutral surfaces, and a clear keyboard focus ring. Keep the existing self-hosted font and use native HTML/CSS.

The supplied HTML confirms a missing label. Its native input and button already support keyboard navigation. No page override, font declaration, submission handler, or endpoint appears in the supplied content.

Replace the form markup with:

```html
<form class="contact-form">
  <label for="contact-email">Email address</label>
  <input
    id="contact-email"
    name="email"
    type="email"
    autocomplete="email"
    required
    aria-describedby="contact-hint"
  >
  <p id="contact-hint">Enter your email address to get in touch.</p>
  <button type="submit">Contact</button>
</form>
```

Add these proposed component tokens and styles to the existing stylesheet. The colors interpret the accepted warm monochrome direction; they are not values supplied by `tokens.md`.

```css
.contact-form {
  --contact-paper: #faf7f2;
  --contact-ink: #292621;
  --contact-border: #746c62;

  display: grid;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 28rem;
  color: var(--contact-ink);
}

.contact-form label {
  font-weight: 600;
}

.contact-form input,
.contact-form button {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 48px;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--contact-border);
  border-radius: 4px;
  font: inherit;
}

.contact-form input {
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  background: var(--contact-paper);
  color: var(--contact-ink);
}

.contact-form p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.contact-form button {
  justify-self: start;
  background: var(--contact-ink);
  color: var(--contact-paper);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.contact-form :is(input, button):focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--contact-ink);
  outline-offset: 3px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--contact-paper);
}
```

Before applying, confirm that email is mandatory. Connect submission to the intended handler; the supplied form currently has no delivery implementation.

