- Tab and Shift+Tab follow email → Contact, with visible, unclipped focus.
- Clicking the label focuses the email field.
- Empty or malformed email triggers validation; Enter submits valid input through the intended handler.
- At 320px width and 200% zoom, controls and text remain usable without horizontal scrolling.
- A screen reader announces “Email address,” its required state, and helper text.

